Illustration Purpose:
Depict a clear moment, relationship, or setting from the story "$title$" based on the above description and character age reference.
The scene must feel like it belongs only to this story — not a generic image.

Style Guide:
- In the style of European children’s picture books from the 1970s–1990s
- Illustrated using watercolor, ink and wash, and colored pencil
- Hand-drawn linework must be visible
- Subtle paper texture present
- Colors should be warm and natural, not neon or digitally glossy

Composition:
- A small, clear scene — characters should be full or half body and centered
- The scene should depict an interaction or moment, not a close-up portrait
- Background supports the scene (e.g. garden, ship, room, castle) but remains secondary
- Suitable for use as a **book thumbnail** — the illustration must be readable even at small sizes

Character Focus:
- Include at least one human character, preferably two or more interacting
- Characters can be children, adults, or a natural mix (parent-child, mentor-student, etc.)
- Characters must match the **Character age reference** — do not default to childlike appearances unless specified
- Faces must feature dot or oval eyes, rounded noses, gentle expressions
- Historically appropriate clothing only
- Characters must appear either clearly children or clearly adults — no ambiguous, chibi, or incorrectly aged styles

Mood and Tone:
- Warm, nostalgic, comforting — suitable for a timeless children’s story
- No dramatic lighting, cinematic effects, or fantasy over-rendering unless required by the story
- Designed for visual clarity at thumbnail size — clean composition and balanced contrast

Strictly Avoid:
- No anime/manga/manhwa styles
- No glossy rendering, shiny eyes/lips, or digital gradients
- No dramatic lighting or intense emotion
- No modern items or clothing
- No generic fantasy art look unless explicitly described
- No close-up portraits with blurred backgrounds — full or half body scene required
- No incorrect age depiction — character age must follow the Character age reference

Output Goal:
A warm, human-centered, vintage illustration in the style of a beloved European children’s picture book, clearly evoking a moment from "$title$", suitable for use as a **thumbnail image**.
Characters should visually match the **Character age reference**, ensuring appropriate depiction of children, adults, or mixed groups as per the story.